B.bj2=new A.e5("How do I pay my rent?",'Elevo does not collect rent. On your home screen, under Rent, you will see the payment instructions your own landlord entered (Zelle, Venmo, bank transfer, check, or cash). Pay them directly, then tap "I Have Paid" so your landlord can confirm it.')
B.bj8=new A.e5("Where can I see my payment history?","Your confirmed payments appear in the payment history section on your home screen. Each entry shows the date, amount, and payment method. Your landlord confirms payments after receiving them \u2014 pending payments show until confirmed.")
B.bj6=new A.e5("What happens if I pay late?","Your landlord can manually add late fees to your account. Any late fees will appear on your rent screen below your base rent amount. Contact your landlord directly via Messages if you have questions about a late fee.")
