B.bjm=new A.e5("Where can I find my lease agreement?","Go to More \u2192 Documents. Your lease agreement and other documents shared by your landlord appear here. Tap any document to preview or download it. You can filter by document type using the chips at the top.")
B.bji=new A.e5("How do I know when my lease expires?","Your home screen shows a lease countdown card with a circular progress indicator, your lease end date, and the exact number of days remaining. Your landlord will also send reminders at 90, 60, and 30 days before expiration (if enabled).")
