B.a5u=new A.aA(62605,"Lucide","lucide_icons",!1)
B.bja=new A.e5("How do I add my first property?","Tap the Properties tab at the bottom of the screen, then tap the + button in the top-right corner or the gold FAB. Fill in your property name, address, and optional photo, then tap Save. Your property will appear immediately in your dashboard.")
B.bj5=new A.e5("How do I invite a tenant to their unit?","Go to More \u2192 Invite Tenant (or tap the gold Invite Tenant tile). Select the vacant unit from the dropdown, enter your tenant's name, email address, and phone number, then tap Send Invitation. Your tenant will receive an email with a link to download Elevo and create their account.")
B.bjp=new A.e5("What is the Private Vault?","The Private Vault (More \u2192 Private Vault) is a landlord-only storage area for sensitive notes, private documents, screening results, and photos related to your units. Tenants can never see vault contents \u2014 even documents you upload there are completely hidden from tenant accounts.")
B.aWI=s([B.bja,B.bj5,B.bjp],t.zX)
B.bj_=new A.hH("Getting Started",B.a5u,B.aWI)
B.bjc=new A.e5("How does per-property pricing work on Essential?","The Essential plan includes 1 property ($39.99/month or $299/year). Each additional property is $12.99/month. The Unlimited plan at $79/month covers unlimited properties.")
B.bjn=new A.e5("What is the Done-for-You setup add-on?","For a one-time fee of $249, the Elevo team will set up all your properties in the app, upload all your existing documents (leases, checklists, inspection reports), and configure your account settings. Ideal if you have multiple properties and want a clean start.")
B.bjl=new A.e5("How do I manage or cancel my subscription?","Go to More \u2192 Subscription & Pricing \u2192 Manage Subscription. This opens the Stripe Customer Portal where you can upgrade, downgrade, update your payment method, or cancel at any time. Changes take effect at the next billing cycle.")
B.bjf=new A.e5("How does the 7-day trial work?","Essential and Unlimited include a 7-day trial. A card is collected upfront and is charged when the trial ends unless you cancel first.")
B.aVS=s([B.bjc,B.bjn,B.bjl,B.bjf],t.zX)
B.biX=new A.hH("Subscriptions & Billing",B.uD,B.aVS)
B.bj1=new A.e5("Does Elevo process rent payments?","No. Elevo is an information and record-keeping tool \u2014 it does not handle money. Rent is paid directly between tenant and landlord using your preferred method (Zelle, Venmo, bank transfer, check, or cash). Elevo records and tracks payment confirmations only.")
B.bjr=new A.e5("How do I enter my preferred payment methods?","Go to More \u2192 Payment Methods. Add each way you accept rent, such as Zelle, Venmo, check, or a bank transfer, with the handle and any instructions. Only your own tenants see them on their rent screen. You can edit, reorder, or remove a method later. Elevo does not collect the money.")
B.bj9=new A.e5("How does the tenant payment confirmation work?",'After a tenant pays you through their chosen method, they tap "I Have Paid" in the app. You receive a push notification and can review the payment record. Tap "Confirm Payment Received" to mark it as confirmed with a timestamp \u2014 this creates a permanent paper trail.')
B.aUY=s([B.bj1,B.bjr,B.bj9],t.zX)
B.biS=new A.hH("Rent & Payments",B.eq,B.aUY)
B.bjo=new A.e5("How does emergency maintenance work?","When a tenant submits a maintenance request with Emergency priority, Elevo immediately sends a push notification to your device \u2014 regardless of your notification preferences. Non-emergency requests also send a push notification and appear in your maintenance queue.")
B.bjj=new A.e5("What is vendor spend limit enforcement?","Each vendor in your directory has a spend limit (the max you authorize per job). When you assign a vendor to a maintenance request and enter an estimated cost at or below their limit, the vendor is notified automatically. If the estimate exceeds their limit, you receive an approval request first \u2014 the vendor is only notified after you approve.")
B.bj7=new A.e5("Can I track multiple vendors?","Yes \u2014 go to More \u2192 Vendors to manage your vendor directory. You can add unlimited vendors with contact info, trade category, and spend limits. Tap any vendor card to view their full profile, edit their information, or see their job history.")
B.aPW=s([B.bjo,B.bjj,B.bj7],t.zX)
B.biT=new A.hH("Maintenance & Vendors",B.dM,B.aPW)
B.bjb=new A.e5("How long are documents stored?","Documents and photos are stored indefinitely in Supabase Storage as long as your Elevo subscription is active. Files are stored in private buckets with daily automatic backups. All download links expire after 1 hour for security \u2014 a new signed URL is generated each time you open a document.")
B.bj0=new A.e5("How do I generate a Move-Out Inspection Report?","Go to a unit's Photos tab (or More \u2192 Photo Log), select the Move-Out tab, and tap Generate Report. Elevo creates a PDF with side-by-side move-in and move-out photos, timestamps, and unit details that you can save or share directly.")
B.bje=new A.e5("What does the P&L report include?","Go to More \u2192 Reports. You can view monthly or annual profit & loss. Income is automatically populated from confirmed rent payments. You can manually add expenses (repairs, HOA fees, insurance, taxes, etc.) and assign them to specific properties. The report shows net profit/loss, margin percentage, and an expense category breakdown.")
B.aUn=s([B.bjb,B.bj0,B.bje],t.zX)
B.biZ=new A.hH("Documents & Reports",B.dn,B.aUn)
B.a5w=new A.aA(62623,"Lucide","lucide_icons",!1)
B.bjk=new A.e5("How much can I charge for a security deposit in Arizona?","Under ARS \xa733-1321, the security deposit cannot exceed 1.5 times the monthly rent for furnished units. For unfurnished units there is no statutory limit, but the deposit must be returned (minus legitimate deductions) within 14 business days of the tenant moving out.")
B.bj3=new A.e5("Can I enter my tenant's unit without notice?","Generally no. Under ARS \xa733-1343, you must provide at least 2 days notice before entering a tenant's unit \u2014 except in genuine emergencies. Entry must be at reasonable times. Failure to provide proper notice can constitute a landlord breach of the rental agreement.")
B.bj4=new A.e5("What is the eviction process in Arizona?","Arizona's eviction (Special Detainer) process requires: (1) Written notice to tenant per ARS \xa733-1368; (2) Filing a complaint with Justice Court after notice period expires; (3) A hearing typically within 3\u20136 business days of filing; (4) Writ of Restitution if landlord prevails. Elevo does not give legal advice. Check the statute or a lawyer for your own case.")
B.aqB=s([B.bjk,B.bj3,B.bj4],t.zX)
B.biV=new A.hH("Arizona Law",B.a5w,B.aqB)
B.IC=s([B.bj_,B.biX,B.biS,B.biT,B.biZ,B.biV],t.hm)
